[Episode 3]</font>

32
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:44,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom.</font>

33
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing</font>

34
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so early in the morning?</font>

35
00:01:48,510 --> 00:01:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm chopping filling.</font>

36
00:01:52,350 --> 00:01:53,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What for?</font>

37
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't it obvious?</font>

38
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't use it for a facial, can I?</font>

39
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Obviously, I'm making dumplings.</font>

40
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

41
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every morning, Dad takes a bath, and you</font>

42
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:05,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">make dumplings?</font>

43
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While I was away in Beijing,</font>

44
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your habits certainly changed fast.</font>

45
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just enjoying life while I can.</font>

46
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that a crime?</font>

47
00:02:13,590 --> 00:02:14,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

48
00:02:14,910 --> 00:02:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then</font>

49
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:16,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let me enjoy life too.</font>

50
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Replace that bed in my room.</font>

51
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wake up</font>

52
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:25,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a 2.5-meter-wide bed,</font>

53
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you're still not satisfied?</font>

54
00:02:26,590 --> 00:02:27,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am.</font>

55
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But my room's only 2.6 meters wide.</font>

56
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even Jia Baoyu didn't sleep in a bed that big.</font>

57
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:32,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That bed is not going anywhere.</font>

58
00:02:32,470 --> 00:02:35,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a memento of your dad's glory days.</font>

59
00:02:35,470 --> 00:02:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's worth more than you are.</font>

60
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

61
00:02:44,630 --> 00:02:45,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me chop the filling.</font>

62
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not happening.</font>

63
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:48,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd better</font>

64
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get back to Rongguo Mansion.</font>

65
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:52,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rongguo Mansion?
[*Jia Baoyu's home]</font>

66
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get back here!</font>

67
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son.</font>

68
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:07,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are you getting to work?</font>

69
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By bus.</font>

70
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't take the bus.</font>

71
00:03:09,910 --> 00:03:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's packed</font>

72
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:11,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the morning.</font>

73
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:13,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already hailed a ride for you.</font>

74
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mom.</font>

75
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What, did our land get requisitioned again?</font>

76
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here. Take your food.</font>

77
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not taking it.</font>

78
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll eat when I get home tonight.</font>

79
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:23,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't come back tonight.</font>

80
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Starting today,</font>

81
00:03:24,630 --> 00:03:26,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're moving into the dorm at work.</font>

82
00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:28,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already cleared it with Logistics.</font>

83
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your dad will bring your luggage over later.</font>

84
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:31,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your ride's here.</font>

85
00:03:31,650 --> 00:03:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom, are you kicking me out?</font>

86
00:03:34,190 --> 00:03:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've thought it through these past two days.</font>

87
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've decided</font>

88
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:39,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to stop obsessing over helping my son</font>

89
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:40,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the sake of my breast health.</font>

90
00:03:40,910 --> 00:03:42,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Am I really your son?</font>

91
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:43,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course you are.</font>

92
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you weren't,</font>

93
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd have gotten a better one.</font>

94
00:03:48,190 --> 00:03:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There you go.</font>

95
00:03:49,030 --> 00:03:50,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, go ahead.</font>

96
00:03:50,150 --> 00:03:51,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's this, Mom?</font>

97
00:03:51,430 --> 00:03:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dumplings.</font>

98
00:03:52,310 --> 00:03:54,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dumplings for departures, noodles for arrivals.</font>

99
00:03:54,910 --> 00:03:56,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was hinting at it all morning.</font>

100
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't even notice.</font>

101
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silly boy.</font>

102
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:00,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Off you go!</font>

103
00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:06,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Name: Wang Can, Position: Embalmer & Restorative Artist]</font>

104
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:13,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Transfer & Registration: Cao Yongji]</font>

105
00:04:13,700 --> 00:04:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Standard Preparation: Chen Hexu, Song Tianshuang]</font>

106
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:19,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Embalming Procedures: Mao Erzhe]</font>

107
00:04:20,420 --> 00:04:23,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Night Duty: Wang Can]</font>

108
00:04:27,270 --> 00:04:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's simple.</font>

109
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just don't get any</font>

110
00:04:29,190 --> 00:04:30,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of this information wrong.</font>

111
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:31,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

112
00:04:32,510 --> 00:04:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why haven't you installed your toilet seat?</font>

113
00:04:34,950 --> 00:04:35,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My dad bought one that's too big.</font>

114
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:37,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

115
00:04:37,070 --> 00:04:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I really need to go tonight,</font>

116
00:04:38,510 --> 00:04:39,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just use the one upstairs.</font>

117
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:40,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, I'll just hold it.</font>

118
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:42,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've only got one transfer coming in tonight.</font>

119
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:43,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you've received them,</font>

120
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">put them in cold storage.</font>

121
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No further prep or treatment is needed.</font>

122
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:47,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

123
00:04:48,870 --> 00:04:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You sure you'll be fine?</font>

124
00:04:50,310 --> 00:04:51,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What could go wrong?</font>

125
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We trained together.</font>

126
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:54,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

127
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off.</font>

128
00:04:55,950 --> 00:04:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

129
00:04:59,510 --> 00:04:59,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

130
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang</font>

131
00:05:01,310 --> 00:05:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bought you a coffee</font>

132
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in case you get sleepy.</font>

133
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:04,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's sweet of her.</font>

134
00:05:04,950 --> 00:05:05,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank her for me.</font>

135
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:06,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good luck.</font>

136
00:05:06,830 --> 00:05:07,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off.</font>

137
00:05:09,070 --> 00:05:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao.</font>

138
00:05:09,830 --> 00:05:10,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uh...</font>

139
00:05:13,390 --> 00:05:13,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

140
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:15,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you have trouble sleeping</font>

141
00:05:15,630 --> 00:05:17,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and feel like chatting with me here,</font>

142
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:17,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that's fine.</font>

143
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:18,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a seat right here.</font>

144
00:05:18,630 --> 00:05:19,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't mind.</font>

145
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:20,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

146
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:22,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I'm not on night duty,</font>

147
00:05:22,190 --> 00:05:23,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to be asleep by midnight.</font>

148
00:05:23,390 --> 00:05:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise it's bad for my liver.</font>

149
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:25,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

150
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off.</font>

151
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Sleep well.</font>

152
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao.</font>

153
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uh...</font>

154
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys start at 6 AM, right?</font>

155
00:05:32,510 --> 00:05:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My shift ends at 6 AM, right?</font>

156
00:05:34,950 --> 00:05:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not too long.</font>

157
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sleep well.</font>

158
00:05:37,390 --> 00:05:38,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao, wait!</font>

159
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:41,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you bring your phone with you?</font>

160
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:42,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's in my pocket.</font>

161
00:05:42,830 --> 00:05:43,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

162
00:05:43,310 --> 00:05:44,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'd be a pain to come back for it.</font>

163
00:05:44,830 --> 00:05:45,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got it.</font>

164
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

165
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

166
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That way!</font>

167
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:50,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Head over there!</font>

168
00:05:50,710 --> 00:05:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

169
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:53,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just keep going.</font>

170
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need so much looking after.</font>

171
00:05:56,220 --> 00:05:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Vehicles Only]</font>

172
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:03,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to walk me back.</font>

173
00:06:03,130 --> 00:06:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can get back on my own.</font>

174
00:06:04,390 --> 00:06:05,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're buddies.</font>

175
00:06:05,310 --> 00:06:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me walk you to the dorm.</font>

176
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not scared.</font>

177
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Neither am I.</font>

178
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off.</font>

179
00:06:11,070 --> 00:06:11,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

180
00:06:12,190 --> 00:06:12,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

181
00:06:14,270 --> 00:06:16,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get your... beauty sleep or whatever.</font>

182
00:06:16,830 --> 00:06:17,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

183
00:06:22,390 --> 00:06:22,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao!</font>

184
00:06:34,870 --> 00:06:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

185
00:06:39,190 --> 00:06:39,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now I know</font>

186
00:06:41,070 --> 00:06:42,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how much it hurts to stand here</font>

187
00:06:45,270 --> 00:06:46,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and watch a friend go.</font>

188
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:54,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao!</font>

189
00:07:06,870 --> 00:07:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">1-0-2-4.</font>

190
00:07:08,430 --> 00:07:09,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the code to my toilet seat.</font>

191
00:07:12,830 --> 00:07:14,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the date of my first night shift,</font>

192
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:16,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I handled a deceased person alone.</font>

193
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:18,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway,</font>

194
00:07:19,830 --> 00:07:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's hard to forget.</font>

195
00:07:40,420 --> 00:07:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Vehicles Only]</font>

196
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang.</font>

197
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're on night duty, huh?</font>

198
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

199
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I brought you some baozi.</font>

200
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've always loved these.</font>

201
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:06,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, sir.</font>

202
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:08,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can,</font>

203
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you had a rough time</font>

204
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">being away?</font>

205
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

206
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:14,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

207
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:17,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's my boy.</font>

208
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you should know, while you were gone,</font>

209
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your friends took it hard.</font>

210
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To be honest,</font>

211
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:26,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've always had high hopes for you.</font>

212
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of all you kids, you have the most potential.</font>

213
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brave, careful, and resourceful.</font>

214
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're on night duty alone tonight.</font>

215
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:33,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you</font>

216
00:10:33,790 --> 00:10:35,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">want me to keep you company?</font>

217
00:10:37,790 --> 00:10:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

218
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not scared.</font>

219
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't sound convincing.</font>

220
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really not scared.</font>

221
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's my boy.</font>

222
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew it.</font>

223
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off, then.</font>

224
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:46,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

225
00:10:47,030 --> 00:10:48,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uh, it's raining.</font>

226
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you sit here for a while?</font>

227
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:50,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

228
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

229
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chen Hexu: Around midnight,]</font>

230
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[if you hear a radio playing,]</font>

231
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[it's Mr. Fang bringing food to the lounge. No need to panic.]</font>

232
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not scared.</font>

233
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In face reading,</font>

234
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these are known as "wealth lips."</font>

235
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:31,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're said to attract wealth, good fortune, and helpful people.</font>

236
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To have wealth lips, you need</font>

237
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this Wealth Lip Trainer.</font>

238
00:12:37,540 --> 00:12:42,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Body Transfer Area]</font>

239
00:13:06,870 --> 00:13:08,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry, but first,</font>

240
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we need to complete the intake registration.</font>

241
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I see the ID, please?</font>

242
00:13:17,670 --> 00:13:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right.</font>

243
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, thank you.</font>

244
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:24,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And your relationship to the deceased?</font>

245
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's my daughter.</font>

246
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

247
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

248
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please keep the ID safe.</font>

249
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And keep this receipt safe too.</font>

250
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll need it for the procedures later.</font>

251
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:41,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

252
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please come outside with me.</font>

253
00:13:41,670 --> 00:13:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

254
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:47,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey,</font>

255
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are we really leaving Yun here all by herself?</font>

256
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:58,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't I stay here with her?</font>

257
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if she wakes up</font>

258
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and wants to go home?</font>

259
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:16,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My condolences.</font>

260
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No! My baby!</font>

261
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No!</font>

262
00:14:53,420 --> 00:14:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Responsible Party: Han Jiangmin]</font>

263
00:14:54,700 --> 00:14:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Traffic accident decedent. Facial features intact.]</font>

264
00:14:56,100 --> 00:14:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No visible facial trauma. Lower limb fracture requires suturing.]</font>

265
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's really coming down.</font>

266
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

267
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, what happened to you?</font>

268
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you look like this?</font>

269
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can,</font>

270
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when someone texts you,</font>

271
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">text them back.</font>

272
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:03,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't video-call them.</font>

273
00:16:03,510 --> 00:16:04,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's intrusive.</font>

274
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:10,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had just wheeled the deceased through Heaven's Gate.</font>

275
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:12,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And when I came back,</font>

276
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she was already there,</font>

277
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right outside the registration room.</font>

278
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She just stood there,</font>

279
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">staring at me.</font>

280
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:19,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wasn't smiling or saying anything.</font>

281
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was soaking wet.</font>

282
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was terrifying!</font>

283
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's pretty serious.</font>

284
00:16:24,030 --> 00:16:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

285
00:16:24,910 --> 00:16:25,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was scared out of my mind!</font>

286
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:26,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want to check the security footage?</font>

287
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:29,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it requires approval.</font>

288
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe,</font>

289
00:16:30,150 --> 00:16:31,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">give him a report form.</font>

290
00:16:31,390 --> 00:16:31,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

291
00:16:32,150 --> 00:16:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry.</font>

292
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you've filled this out,</font>

293
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">submit it to the Personnel Office right away.</font>

294
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

295
00:16:38,130 --> 00:16:39,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me a pen.</font>

296
00:16:40,670 --> 00:16:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make sure your handwriting is neat.</font>

297
00:16:41,670 --> 00:16:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

298
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, show me how to fill it out.</font>

299
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:44,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

300
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:46,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time and place.</font>

301
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:47,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People involved.</font>

302
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:47,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your name.</font>

303
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The time was...</font>

304
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Description of the incident"?</font>

305
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:55,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened? Write down the facts.</font>

306
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"I saw a ghost"?</font>

307
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

308
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:01,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just write "I saw a ghost"?</font>

309
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

310
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:10,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Was there any physical violence or verbal abuse?"</font>

311
00:17:12,110 --> 00:17:13,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. Did she hit you</font>

312
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or insult you?</font>

313
00:17:15,830 --> 00:17:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

314
00:17:16,590 --> 00:17:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then write "No."</font>

315
00:17:17,830 --> 00:17:19,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will management still do anything?</font>

316
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry. Just tell the truth.</font>

317
00:17:24,110 --> 00:17:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do I put under "Requested Action"?</font>

318
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Review the footage.</font>

319
00:17:26,590 --> 00:17:27,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Review the footage."</font>

320
00:17:30,350 --> 00:17:32,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Assessment of incident severity and nature."</font>

321
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How serious did it feel to you?</font>

322
00:17:37,310 --> 00:17:38,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very serious.</font>

323
00:17:39,790 --> 00:17:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Write that down.</font>

324
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see.</font>

325
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan,</font>

326
00:17:48,790 --> 00:17:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could you sign this as the supervisor?</font>

327
00:17:52,830 --> 00:17:53,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Saw a ghost"?</font>

328
00:17:54,030 --> 00:17:55,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm seeing one too.</font>

329
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is wrong with you people in Cremation?</font>

330
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many cremation furnaces do you have?</font>

331
00:18:05,830 --> 00:18:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are only three in total,</font>

332
00:18:07,270 --> 00:18:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you've scheduled eight decedents</font>

333
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all for the first cremation slot.</font>

334
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you trying to create a morning rush over there?</font>

335
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are we supposed to thaw them and do their makeup in time?</font>

336
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough. Don't tell me how to do my job.</font>

337
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't even manage your own schedule.</font>

338
00:18:19,070 --> 00:18:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're doing it our way.</font>

339
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you,</font>

340
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go by their condition and how far</font>

341
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:24,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they've thawed.</font>

342
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:26,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoever's ready first goes first.</font>

343
00:18:26,590 --> 00:18:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's it.</font>

344
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened to you?</font>

345
00:18:34,310 --> 00:18:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What ghost did you see?</font>

346
00:18:36,110 --> 00:18:36,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing.</font>

347
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Last night...</font>

348
00:18:38,830 --> 00:18:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just feel kind of chilled all over now.</font>

349
00:18:41,590 --> 00:18:42,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chilled?</font>

350
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:44,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you go work in Cremation?</font>

351
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's warm over there.</font>

352
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Morning!</font>

353
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:48,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Morning!</font>

354
00:18:50,070 --> 00:18:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well,</font>

355
00:18:51,110 --> 00:18:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">listen up.</font>

356
00:18:52,310 --> 00:18:54,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I ran into someone from the Business Department in the lobby.</font>

357
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:55,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A decedent's family coming tomorrow</font>

358
00:18:55,590 --> 00:18:56,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been in touch with them.</font>

359
00:18:57,070 --> 00:18:58,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They have a personal request</font>

360
00:18:59,110 --> 00:19:00,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and want someone from our team to handle it.</font>

361
00:19:01,070 --> 00:19:01,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan,</font>

362
00:19:02,070 --> 00:19:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could you arrange that?</font>

363
00:19:03,310 --> 00:19:03,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

364
00:19:04,830 --> 00:19:06,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One more thing I want to emphasize.</font>

365
00:19:06,790 --> 00:19:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we</font>

366
00:19:07,510 --> 00:19:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">deal with coworkers from other teams,</font>

367
00:19:10,070 --> 00:19:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">watch how you handle things.</font>

368
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go off on everyone when you get worked up.</font>

369
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We should treat our coworkers</font>

370
00:19:15,830 --> 00:19:17,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the same way we treat the deceased:</font>

371
00:19:17,110 --> 00:19:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with patience and gentleness.</font>

372
00:19:18,550 --> 00:19:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, if they complain,</font>

373
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:20,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the one who has to buy them dinner.</font>

374
00:19:20,590 --> 00:19:21,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, thanks.</font>

375
00:19:23,590 --> 00:19:24,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're welcome. My pleasure.</font>

376
00:19:29,550 --> 00:19:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

377
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been here a few days, right?</font>

378
00:19:37,790 --> 00:19:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you're not exactly new anymore.</font>

379
00:19:39,830 --> 00:19:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every newbie becomes an old hand eventually.</font>

380
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you keep drifting around,</font>

381
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll turn into a deadweight.</font>

382
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:45,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it?</font>

383
00:19:45,590 --> 00:19:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to work toward a goal.</font>

384
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get your</font>

385
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:50,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fifth Level certification as soon as you can.</font>

386
00:19:50,590 --> 00:19:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay?</font>

387
00:19:51,070 --> 00:19:51,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

388
00:19:52,070 --> 00:19:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you do it?</font>

389
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:54,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

390
00:19:55,790 --> 00:19:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's this?</font>

391
00:20:01,310 --> 00:20:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wrote this?</font>

392
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:05,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it true?</font>

393
00:20:06,350 --> 00:20:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is.</font>

394
00:20:13,550 --> 00:20:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finally, someone's taking me seriously.</font>

395
00:20:15,590 --> 00:20:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's a bit tricky.</font>

396
00:20:18,070 --> 00:20:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

397
00:20:19,310 --> 00:20:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

398
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu said</font>

399
00:20:21,670 --> 00:20:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this form needs a supervisor's signature.</font>

400
00:20:24,350 --> 00:20:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So...</font>

401
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:25,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll sign it in a minute</font>

402
00:20:26,070 --> 00:20:27,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and give it to the Head Director.</font>

403
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He'll get it sorted out, okay?</font>

404
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have one more question.</font>

405
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In our line of work, has everyone</font>

406
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">seen things?</font>

407
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never seen anything.</font>

408
00:20:42,830 --> 00:20:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But think about it.</font>

409
00:20:44,070 --> 00:20:44,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who isn't scared?</font>

410
00:20:47,830 --> 00:20:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I worked my first night shift,</font>

411
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:50,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was even younger than you are now.</font>

412
00:20:51,790 --> 00:20:53,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so scared I didn't use the restroom all night.</font>

413
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

414
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:54,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I held it till morning.</font>

415
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After that, whenever I worked nights,</font>

416
00:20:56,310 --> 00:20:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd wear an adult diaper.</font>

417
00:20:59,110 --> 00:20:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now,</font>

418
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my bladder's in great shape.</font>

419
00:21:01,310 --> 00:21:02,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At this year's staff physical,</font>

420
00:21:02,270 --> 00:21:03,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm definitely making the top three.</font>

421
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:06,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impressive.</font>

422
00:21:06,830 --> 00:21:07,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a ranking for that?</font>

423
00:21:08,030 --> 00:21:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Middle-aged guys get competitive too.</font>

424
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:10,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can go now.</font>

425
00:21:17,590 --> 00:21:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well,</font>

426
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I brought the pen already.</font>

427
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, then.</font>

428
00:21:22,900 --> 00:21:24,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Signature: Cao Yongji]</font>

429
00:21:25,350 --> 00:21:26,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Uncle Cao.</font>

430
00:21:27,310 --> 00:21:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did that come from?</font>

431
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:29,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, you and my dad are buddies.</font>

432
00:21:30,310 --> 00:21:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At work, I'm the team leader.</font>

433
00:21:32,110 --> 00:21:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, go.</font>

434
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in early tomorrow.</font>

435
00:21:34,110 --> 00:21:35,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And learn more from Hexu, okay?</font>

436
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

437
00:21:38,270 --> 00:21:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you change by yourself.</font>

438
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao.</font>

439
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Cao wants me to get my Fifth Level certification.</font>

440
00:21:58,590 --> 00:21:59,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you</font>

441
00:21:59,350 --> 00:22:00,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tutor me?</font>

442
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:02,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't we</font>

443
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take the exam before graduation?</font>

444
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't pass?</font>

445
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

446
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What tripped you up?</font>

447
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Restorative work or embalming?</font>

448
00:22:12,070 --> 00:22:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I forgot to set an alarm</font>

449
00:22:13,880 --> 00:22:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and overslept.</font>

450
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell you what.</font>

451
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These notes of mine</font>

452
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cover embalming supply prep</font>

453
00:22:22,590 --> 00:22:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and how to use</font>

454
00:22:24,070 --> 00:22:24,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the common</font>

455
00:22:24,680 --> 00:22:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">disinfectants.</font>

456
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Memorize everything,</font>

457
00:22:26,750 --> 00:22:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you'll pass the exam.</font>

458
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to memorize</font>

459
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:29,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all of it?</font>

460
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, well,</font>

461
00:22:32,310 --> 00:22:33,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you hang on to it for now.</font>

462
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mao.</font>

463
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:35,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll come to you when I need it.</font>

464
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew you wouldn't</font>

465
00:22:37,750 --> 00:22:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">want to memorize it.</font>

466
00:22:38,510 --> 00:22:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What level are you now?</font>

467
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Third Level.</font>

468
00:22:40,640 --> 00:22:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about Chen Hexu?</font>

469
00:22:41,720 --> 00:22:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's Second Level.</font>

470
00:22:43,030 --> 00:22:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're both so far ahead?</font>

471
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry about everyone else's level.</font>

472
00:22:46,070 --> 00:22:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you won't memorize the notes,</font>

473
00:22:47,400 --> 00:22:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then learn by doing.</font>

474
00:22:48,510 --> 00:22:49,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang will be</font>

475
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bringing in a decedent later.</font>

476
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The family requested</font>

477
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:54,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a simple hair wash</font>

478
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a quick comb-through.</font>

479
00:22:56,350 --> 00:22:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you handle that?</font>

480
00:22:57,460 --> 00:22:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just washing hair. Who can't?</font>

481
00:22:58,750 --> 00:22:59,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

482
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen.</font>

483
00:23:00,510 --> 00:23:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With elderly decedents,</font>

484
00:23:02,110 --> 00:23:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before death,</font>

485
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">blood circulation is usually slower.</font>

486
00:23:05,070 --> 00:23:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That can loosen the follicles</font>

487
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and cause hair loss.</font>

488
00:23:07,440 --> 00:23:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Younger people tend to fare better.</font>

489
00:23:09,310 --> 00:23:09,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Better how?</font>

490
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:11,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young people are under so much stress now.</font>

491
00:23:11,110 --> 00:23:12,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They lose hair too.</font>

492
00:23:12,070 --> 00:23:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It comes out in handfuls.</font>

493
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you need to be even more careful.</font>

494
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:16,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to be very gentle</font>

495
00:23:17,070 --> 00:23:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so your fingers don't snag the hair.</font>

496
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:22,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you actually get it?</font>

497
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

498
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll show you</font>

499
00:23:24,070 --> 00:23:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you don't mess it up.</font>

500
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:25,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

501
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just learn from Hexu.</font>

502
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't she Second Level?</font>

503
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll ask...</font>

504
00:23:28,310 --> 00:23:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why Hexu?</font>

505
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:30,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't bother her.</font>

506
00:23:30,070 --> 00:23:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Fifth Level stuff.</font>

507
00:23:31,750 --> 00:23:32,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come here. - What are you doing?</font>

508
00:23:32,970 --> 00:23:33,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- What are you doing?
- Come on, lean back.</font>

509
00:23:34,070 --> 00:23:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- No, I'm... - Listen.</font>

510
00:23:35,140 --> 00:23:35,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I'm ticklish. - When you do this...</font>

511
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move.</font>

512
00:23:36,590 --> 00:23:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest the pads of your fingers</font>

513
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gently against the scalp.</font>

514
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then slowly massage</font>

515
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:42,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like this.</font>

516
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

517
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't let your fingers snag the hair.</font>

518
00:23:47,510 --> 00:23:48,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got the feel for it?</font>

519
00:23:48,350 --> 00:23:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I feel it.</font>

520
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It feels pretty good.</font>

521
00:23:53,750 --> 00:23:54,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, really good.</font>

522
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

523
00:24:12,350 --> 00:24:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just watching you two.</font>

524
00:24:15,590 --> 00:24:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's Qixi today.
[*Qixi: Chinese Valentine's Day]</font>

525
00:24:18,270 --> 00:24:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you go</font>

526
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">receive a decedent?</font>

527
00:24:21,310 --> 00:24:22,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The family's in a hurry.</font>

528
00:24:22,350 --> 00:24:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can one of you help me?</font>

529
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on. You help her.</font>

530
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:26,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why me? Why don't you go?</font>

531
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Third Level.</font>

532
00:24:28,680 --> 00:24:30,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can help you prepare for the exam.</font>

533
00:24:30,750 --> 00:24:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

534
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pass it in no time.</font>

535
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What level are you now?</font>

536
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fourth Level.</font>

537
00:24:41,590 --> 00:24:42,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even you're Fourth Level?</font>

538
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's that supposed to mean?</font>

539
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing.</font>

540
00:24:45,350 --> 00:24:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean,</font>

541
00:24:45,920 --> 00:24:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can handle things on your own now.</font>

542
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

543
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:49,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can,</font>

544
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:50,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">want me to quiz you?</font>

545
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember the steps for dressing the deceased?</font>

546
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Socks, pants, then the top.</font>

547
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:55,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

548
00:24:55,350 --> 00:24:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And remember "gold below, silver above"?</font>

549
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Know when to stop, okay?</font>

550
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I remember all that.</font>

551
00:24:58,920 --> 00:24:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just trying to help.</font>

552
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:00,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

553
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So today's Qixi, huh?</font>

554
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:03,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

555
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are you celebrating?</font>

556
00:25:05,310 --> 00:25:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With my Muyun, of course.</font>

557
00:25:08,070 --> 00:25:08,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That idol of yours?</font>

558
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:11,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about Hexu?</font>

559
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu?</font>

560
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She'll probably drink alone tonight.</font>

561
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't she spending it with her boyfriend?</font>

562
00:25:18,110 --> 00:25:19,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She doesn't have one.</font>

563
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Work's been stressing her out.</font>

564
00:25:22,200 --> 00:25:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I think you...</font>

565
00:25:25,880 --> 00:25:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can!</font>

566
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you going to help me?</font>

567
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have fun with Muyun.</font>

568
00:25:30,680 --> 00:25:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're ditching me again!</font>

569
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:36,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu,</font>

570
00:25:38,440 --> 00:25:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you know what day it is?</font>

571
00:25:41,750 --> 00:25:42,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

572
00:25:43,160 --> 00:25:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The day you saw a ghost.</font>

573
00:25:47,160 --> 00:25:50,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the day the Cowherd meets the Weaver Girl.</font>

574
00:25:52,350 --> 00:25:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The seventh day of the seventh lunar month.</font>

575
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qixi.</font>

576
00:26:00,310 --> 00:26:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Days like this</font>

577
00:26:01,750 --> 00:26:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't really matter to us.</font>

578
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We take days</font>

579
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like the Qingming and Zhongyuan Festivals</font>

580
00:26:07,110 --> 00:26:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more seriously.</font>

581
00:26:09,310 --> 00:26:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we celebrate something the living care about?</font>

582
00:26:14,440 --> 00:26:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am alive.</font>

583
00:26:15,440 --> 00:26:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And those are the holidays I care about.</font>

584
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">More people make offerings then,</font>

585
00:26:18,510 --> 00:26:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so the Business Department needs extra help,</font>

586
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:20,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we get overtime pay.</font>

587
00:26:21,960 --> 00:26:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

588
00:26:23,310 --> 00:26:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All you care about is money.</font>

589
00:26:28,440 --> 00:26:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't touch anything.</font>

590
00:26:32,720 --> 00:26:34,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, keep quiet.</font>

591
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:50,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you two doing just standing there?</font>

592
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing to do?</font>

593
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:53,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A body just came in. Come help.</font>

594
00:26:54,160 --> 00:26:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan!</font>

595
00:26:55,750 --> 00:26:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The body in there is coming.</font>

596
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must've summoned it.</font>

597
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop talking nonsense.</font>

598
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

599
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you there was a ghost!</font>

600
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:16,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no body in there.</font>

601
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

602
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open it.</font>

603
00:27:29,720 --> 00:27:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry. My hands are dirty.</font>

604
00:27:50,480 --> 00:27:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Happy Qixi.</font>

605
00:27:51,510 --> 00:27:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you got nothing better to do</font>

606
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than hide in there and scare us?</font>

607
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't your team report this for repair?</font>

608
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to check it out.</font>

609
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, you didn't say you were coming today.</font>

610
00:27:58,310 --> 00:27:59,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swapped shifts.</font>

611
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:00,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan, if I hadn't switched shifts today,</font>

612
00:28:00,920 --> 00:28:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never would've caught your people</font>

613
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">standing around here flirting.</font>

614
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right. Come out when you're done.</font>

615
00:28:07,720 --> 00:28:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's freezing in there.</font>

616
00:28:14,070 --> 00:28:14,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey,</font>

617
00:28:15,750 --> 00:28:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could you tell we were flirting?</font>

618
00:28:24,110 --> 00:28:24,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello?</font>

619
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:26,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello?</font>

620
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello?</font>

621
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:32,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can anyone hear me?</font>

622
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello?</font>

623
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:41,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello?</font>

624
00:28:44,590 --> 00:28:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it broken?</font>

625
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should we tell him?</font>

626
00:28:51,590 --> 00:28:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it. Let's work first.</font>

627
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:54,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't leave the deceased lying here.</font>

628
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can, there you are.</font>

629
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

630
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was looking for you.</font>

631
00:28:58,440 --> 00:28:59,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

632
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did the Head Director say?</font>

633
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just came from his office.</font>

634
00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's taking this very seriously.</font>

635
00:29:04,270 --> 00:29:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But there are procedures we have to follow,</font>

636
00:29:05,830 --> 00:29:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so it'll take some time.</font>

637
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll let you know as soon as I hear anything.</font>

638
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

639
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:11,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Things are quiet right now. Let's have a heart-to-heart.</font>

640
00:29:13,480 --> 00:29:14,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure. Shall we go inside?</font>

641
00:29:14,590 --> 00:29:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just sit here.</font>

642
00:29:15,980 --> 00:29:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Body transfer in progress. Please wait.]</font>

643
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no body right now. Why put that out?</font>

644
00:29:20,680 --> 00:29:22,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's it been since you came back?</font>

645
00:29:23,590 --> 00:29:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty good.</font>

646
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's felt</font>

647
00:29:25,960 --> 00:29:27,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">both familiar and unfamiliar.</font>

648
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean, what we studied in school</font>

649
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was all this professional stuff,</font>

650
00:29:31,070 --> 00:29:33,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I'm still a little rusty.</font>

651
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:35,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I totally understand.</font>

652
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been away from the field</font>

653
00:29:36,720 --> 00:29:37,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for years.</font>

654
00:29:37,530 --> 00:29:37,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

655
00:29:37,970 --> 00:29:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll take time.</font>

656
00:29:39,200 --> 00:29:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ask them to help you out more.</font>

657
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean,</font>

658
00:29:45,720 --> 00:29:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we still chat and eat together,</font>

659
00:29:48,510 --> 00:29:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but they still seem</font>

660
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:51,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a little distant with me.</font>

661
00:29:52,110 --> 00:29:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you're overthinking it.</font>

662
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The past is in the past.</font>

663
00:29:56,160 --> 00:29:57,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think they actually like you a lot.</font>

664
00:29:58,350 --> 00:29:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

665
00:29:58,920 --> 00:29:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

666
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take Tianshuang.</font>

667
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She may seem a little scatterbrained...</font>

668
00:30:03,300 --> 00:30:04,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm scatterbrained?</font>

669
00:30:05,250 --> 00:30:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's talking about you.</font>

670
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:06,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But she's genuine.</font>

671
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:07,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you first came back,</font>

672
00:30:07,990 --> 00:30:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wasn't she the happiest to see you?</font>

673
00:30:09,160 --> 00:30:09,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

674
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were close when we were kids.</font>

675
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:11,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

676
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And Hexu.</font>

677
00:30:12,480 --> 00:30:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She walks around looking grumpy every day,</font>

678
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:15,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it's all an act.</font>

679
00:30:15,960 --> 00:30:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's actually very sensitive,</font>

680
00:30:17,200 --> 00:30:19,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'm sure she likes you the most.</font>

681
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:20,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

682
00:30:20,880 --> 00:30:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

683
00:30:22,100 --> 00:30:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you should help her out more.</font>

684
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:24,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Okay. - Otherwise, one day,</font>

685
00:30:24,790 --> 00:30:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'll turn into Dandan.</font>

686
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with Dandan?</font>

687
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's right with her?</font>

688
00:30:39,590 --> 00:30:40,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's okay.</font>

689
00:30:40,270 --> 00:30:40,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan</font>

690
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">isn't exactly young anymore.</font>

691
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:44,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's incredibly eccentric,</font>

692
00:30:44,310 --> 00:30:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has a terrible temper,</font>

693
00:30:45,960 --> 00:30:47,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">takes everything way too seriously,</font>

694
00:30:47,510 --> 00:30:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and is deeply twisted inside.</font>

695
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want Hexu to end up like that?</font>

696
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I don't.</font>

697
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:53,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go tell Dandan.</font>

698
00:30:53,930 --> 00:30:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- That's why...
- Do they have a death wish?</font>

699
00:30:55,770 --> 00:30:56,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone like you,</font>

700
00:30:56,390 --> 00:30:58,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">positive, upbeat, and outgoing,</font>

701
00:30:58,580 --> 00:31:00,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is really important to the team.</font>

702
00:31:00,440 --> 00:31:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

703
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:03,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you need to apply yourself and improve.</font>

704
00:31:04,030 --> 00:31:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, the gap will only get bigger.</font>

705
00:31:06,070 --> 00:31:06,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at Mao.</font>

706
00:31:07,350 --> 00:31:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When he was a kid, didn't he follow you everywhere,</font>

707
00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- always sniffling... - Yeah.</font>

708
00:31:10,880 --> 00:31:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dragging his shoes around,</font>

709
00:31:11,920 --> 00:31:13,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and always bugging you</font>

710
00:31:13,310 --> 00:31:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like a total dummy?</font>

711
00:31:14,850 --> 00:31:16,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Now he's Third Level.
- I never bugged him.</font>

712
00:31:16,940 --> 00:31:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His level and pay are way above yours.</font>

713
00:31:17,920 --> 00:31:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dummy.</font>

714
00:31:19,790 --> 00:31:22,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So work hard and catch up with him, even surpass him.</font>

715
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:23,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

716
00:31:24,110 --> 00:31:24,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

717
00:31:24,620 --> 00:31:25,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't let you down.</font>

718
00:31:26,000 --> 00:31:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You promise?</font>

719
00:31:26,830 --> 00:31:27,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

720
00:31:27,310 --> 00:31:27,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

721
00:31:28,200 --> 00:31:29,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have my full support.</font>

722
00:31:29,240 --> 00:31:29,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

723
00:31:29,750 --> 00:31:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got this!</font>

724
00:31:30,350 --> 00:31:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do!</font>

725
00:31:31,110 --> 00:31:31,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, sir.</font>

726
00:31:33,890 --> 00:31:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's something I've been meaning to say.</font>

727
00:31:36,580 --> 00:31:38,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our line of work is pretty unusual,</font>

728
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the stress can be intense.</font>

729
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:40,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So</font>

730
00:31:40,350 --> 00:31:42,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you need a way to let off steam.</font>

731
00:31:43,110 --> 00:31:44,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take Fang.</font>

732
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He listens to music or opera.</font>

733
00:31:46,110 --> 00:31:46,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at him now.</font>

734
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:48,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's like a big kid.</font>

735
00:31:48,110 --> 00:31:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So... find ways to unwind?</font>

736
00:31:49,030 --> 00:31:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

737
00:31:49,590 --> 00:31:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

738
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, sir.</font>

739
00:31:51,400 --> 00:31:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep it up.</font>

740
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:52,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

741
00:31:58,510 --> 00:31:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Use headphones when you listen to music.</font>

742
00:32:00,310 --> 00:32:00,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

743
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:01,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be considerate.</font>

744
00:32:04,200 --> 00:32:04,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see.</font>

745
00:32:14,590 --> 00:32:19,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Flowers bloom in spring♪</font>

746
00:32:19,830 --> 00:32:23,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Fourteen, fifteen, sixteen♪</font>

747
00:32:24,550 --> 00:32:25,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next one.</font>

748
00:32:26,920 --> 00:32:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The New Year is in the first lunar month♪</font>

749
00:32:30,270 --> 00:32:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪New Year's Day is the very first day♪</font>

750
00:32:32,960 --> 00:32:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone might file a noise complaint.</font>

751
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Every family reunites♪</font>

752
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:40,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The young pay respects to the old♪</font>

753
00:32:40,350 --> 00:32:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me.</font>

754
00:32:41,830 --> 00:32:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Whether you're a man♪</font>

755
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next one.</font>

756
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me.</font>

757
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Excuse me. - Is someone else talking?</font>

758
00:32:49,940 --> 00:32:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is someone else there?</font>

759
00:32:50,920 --> 00:32:52,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Joy fills my heart♪</font>

760
00:32:53,160 --> 00:33:00,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I stand by the palace gate and call out the troops♪</font>

761
00:33:05,510 --> 00:33:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

762
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for the trouble.</font>

763
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When they brought my sister here,</font>

764
00:33:21,350 --> 00:33:22,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my parents wouldn't let me come.</font>

765
00:33:23,310 --> 00:33:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came here secretly.</font>

766
00:33:25,240 --> 00:33:26,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They probably didn't tell you</font>

767
00:33:27,110 --> 00:33:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that my sister and I were twins.</font>

768
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:31,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really sorry.</font>

769
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We did overlook that.</font>

770
00:33:33,590 --> 00:33:35,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we received the deceased,</font>

771
00:33:35,510 --> 00:33:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we only registered the parents</font>

772
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and didn't ask whether she had any siblings.</font>

773
00:33:40,590 --> 00:33:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was our oversight. We're sorry.</font>

774
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:43,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll make sure this doesn't happen again.</font>

775
00:33:43,920 --> 00:33:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Business Department told us</font>

776
00:33:45,590 --> 00:33:46,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you'd like</font>

777
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the deceased to be dressed in her own clothes, correct?</font>

778
00:33:49,590 --> 00:33:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

779
00:33:50,310 --> 00:33:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

780
00:33:56,270 --> 00:33:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This was</font>

781
00:33:58,030 --> 00:33:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my sister's favorite hanfu outfit.</font>

782
00:34:01,350 --> 00:34:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My parents never wanted her to fuss too much</font>

783
00:34:03,070 --> 00:34:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">over clothes and makeup,</font>

784
00:34:05,920 --> 00:34:07,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she always wore it in secret.</font>

785
00:34:10,110 --> 00:34:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

786
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this time,</font>

787
00:34:14,150 --> 00:34:14,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want her</font>

788
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to look beautiful and leave in peace.</font>

789
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:25,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've heard that hanfu</font>

790
00:34:26,320 --> 00:34:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has to be put on a certain way.</font>

791
00:34:28,630 --> 00:34:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you mind</font>

792
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">showing me how to dress her in it?</font>

793
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:32,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise,</font>

794
00:34:32,280 --> 00:34:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid I might not do justice to your wishes.</font>

795
00:34:34,070 --> 00:34:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

796
00:34:35,230 --> 00:34:37,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a Tang-style outfit</font>

797
00:34:37,960 --> 00:34:39,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with a chest-high ruqun.</font>

798
00:34:40,150 --> 00:34:42,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what she told me.</font>

799
00:34:42,840 --> 00:34:43,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

800
00:34:43,550 --> 00:34:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll look it up</font>

801
00:34:44,480 --> 00:34:45,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and learn how to do it.</font>

802
00:34:46,070 --> 00:34:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Um,</font>

803
00:34:48,670 --> 00:34:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before the memorial,</font>

804
00:34:50,360 --> 00:34:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could I dress her</font>

805
00:34:52,670 --> 00:34:53,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">myself?</font>

806
00:34:55,880 --> 00:34:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Normally,</font>

807
00:34:57,590 --> 00:34:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when a family member has a special request,</font>

808
00:34:59,030 --> 00:35:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we try our best to accommodate it.</font>

809
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But for this,</font>

810
00:35:02,510 --> 00:35:03,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'd still need</font>

811
00:35:03,360 --> 00:35:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to check with our supervisor first.</font>

812
00:35:05,550 --> 00:35:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

813
00:35:11,110 --> 00:35:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

814
00:35:23,710 --> 00:35:24,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My condolences.</font>

815
00:35:25,230 --> 00:35:25,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My condolences.</font>

816
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duo?</font>

817
00:35:39,590 --> 00:35:40,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duo,</font>

818
00:35:40,760 --> 00:35:41,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what are you doing here?</font>

819
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to bring clothes for my sister.</font>

820
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:45,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What clothes?</font>

821
00:35:45,760 --> 00:35:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her favorite hanfu outfit.</font>

822
00:35:47,550 --> 00:35:49,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want her to be laid to rest in it!</font>

823
00:35:49,630 --> 00:35:52,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wearing burial clothes is an old tradition.</font>

824
00:35:53,000 --> 00:35:54,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we break the rules,</font>

825
00:35:54,550 --> 00:35:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it could be bad for your sister in the next life!</font>

826
00:35:57,070 --> 00:35:59,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What next life does she even have?</font>

827
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:01,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You controlled her when she was alive.</font>

828
00:36:01,320 --> 00:36:02,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you're still trying to control her now.</font>

829
00:36:02,670 --> 00:36:04,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You even want to control her next life.</font>

830
00:36:04,440 --> 00:36:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of ridiculous rule is that?</font>

831
00:36:06,190 --> 00:36:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I'm done following those rules! - Duo!</font>

832
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duo!</font>

833
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duo!</font>

834
00:36:37,110 --> 00:36:38,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's where things stand.</font>

835
00:36:38,510 --> 00:36:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The parents agreed to let the deceased wear hanfu,</font>

836
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:41,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but</font>

837
00:36:41,760 --> 00:36:43,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they refused to let her sister come in to dress her,</font>

838
00:36:43,550 --> 00:36:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we'll have to do it ourselves.</font>

839
00:36:45,110 --> 00:36:46,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's understandable that they have reservations.</font>

840
00:36:46,710 --> 00:36:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's still young, after all.</font>

841
00:36:47,550 --> 00:36:48,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

842
00:36:48,590 --> 00:36:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The memorial service is already scheduled,</font>

843
00:36:50,480 --> 00:36:51,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we need to hurry.</font>

844
00:36:51,510 --> 00:36:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu,</font>

845
00:36:52,320 --> 00:36:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you learned how to put on the outfit?</font>

846
00:36:53,760 --> 00:36:54,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't had time to look yet.</font>

847
00:36:54,710 --> 00:36:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll learn now.</font>

848
00:36:55,720 --> 00:36:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Okay. - It's fine.</font>

849
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

850
00:36:57,880 --> 00:36:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know how.</font>

851
00:36:58,840 --> 00:36:59,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You do?</font>

852
00:37:00,320 --> 00:37:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know a little about traditional Chinese culture.</font>

853
00:37:02,550 --> 00:37:03,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't do it.</font>

854
00:37:03,550 --> 00:37:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The family specifically said</font>

855
00:37:04,480 --> 00:37:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the deceased must be attended to by a woman.</font>

856
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll dress her.</font>

857
00:37:08,550 --> 00:37:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You teach me.</font>

858
00:37:10,030 --> 00:37:10,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That works.</font>

859
00:37:11,590 --> 00:37:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The hanfu outfit should have two pieces.</font>

860
00:37:14,190 --> 00:37:15,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, underneath,</font>

861
00:37:16,190 --> 00:37:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's a top.</font>

862
00:37:17,440 --> 00:37:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty similar to this.</font>

863
00:37:18,360 --> 00:37:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then there are the ties.</font>

864
00:37:19,960 --> 00:37:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just fasten them.</font>

865
00:37:21,710 --> 00:37:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The ruqun has to wrap around the back, okay?</font>

866
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You... right.</font>

867
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:26,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pick up the ruqun.</font>

868
00:37:26,840 --> 00:37:27,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then</font>

869
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:29,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bring it around from behind her.</font>

870
00:37:29,400 --> 00:37:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And</font>

871
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:31,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since it's one whole piece,</font>

872
00:37:31,150 --> 00:37:32,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you cover this side first...</font>

873
00:37:45,940 --> 00:37:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I drift along through time♪</font>

874
00:37:49,860 --> 00:37:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪And let memory's tenderness♪</font>

875
00:37:53,020 --> 00:37:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Carry me to freedom♪</font>

876
00:37:57,780 --> 00:38:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In my panic, I hold on tight♪</font>

877
00:38:01,700 --> 00:38:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪As if I've gained nothing at all♪</font>

878
00:38:03,620 --> 00:38:06,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I get lonely, I make mistakes♪</font>

879
00:38:08,060 --> 00:38:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In an embrace, I feel boundless...♪</font>

880
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:14,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, that's it.</font>

881
00:38:14,920 --> 00:38:15,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's everything.</font>

882
00:38:16,030 --> 00:38:16,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

883
00:38:16,920 --> 00:38:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

884
00:38:19,340 --> 00:38:21,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In every♪</font>

885
00:38:21,380 --> 00:38:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Moment of missing you♪</font>

886
00:38:23,980 --> 00:38:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I linger there awhile♪</font>

887
00:38:31,020 --> 00:38:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I look up at the stars♪</font>

888
00:38:34,860 --> 00:38:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Who hasn't stumbled bravely on♪</font>

889
00:38:38,260 --> 00:38:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Chasing the ever-changing sky?♪</font>

890
00:38:42,180 --> 00:38:45,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this earthly life♪</font>

891
00:38:46,180 --> 00:38:49,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Who hasn't faced the wind despite the pain♪</font>

892
00:38:49,620 --> 00:38:52,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Holding fast to love and what we have?♪</font>

893
00:38:53,980 --> 00:38:56,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I have loved deeply...♪</font>

894
00:38:56,070 --> 00:38:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Makeup complete.</font>

895
